# Rule for this repo: commit sources, exclude derivatives.
# Everything ignored below is regenerated by a script that IS committed, so a
# fresh clone can rebuild all of it. See README.md "Rebuilding from a clone".

# --- Trained model artifacts (4.2 GB) -------------------------------------
# Regenerated by finetune_xlmr.py (needs a GPU) and baseline_train.py (CPU, minutes).
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/xlmr_toxicity_model/
*.joblib
*.safetensors
*.pt

# --- Derived datasets ------------------------------------------------------
# The source of truth is azerbaijani_toxicity_dataset.csv, which IS committed.
# These are deterministic outputs of it (all seeded), in pipeline order:
#   fix_label_conflicts.py -> _fixed.csv
#   split_dataset.py       -> _train / _val / _test.csv   (seed 42)
#   augment_data.py        -> _train_augmented.csv        (seed 42)
#   audit_labels.py        -> _train_relabeled.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_dataset_fixed.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_train.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_val.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_test.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_train_augmented.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/azerbaijani_toxicity_train_relabeled.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/label_review_candidates.csv

# --- Lexicon build output --------------------------------------------------
# data/dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is generated, but it is also the
# deliverable -- the bad-word dataset itself, ~300 KB -- so a clone is usable
# and its tests pass without running the build first.
#
# Ignored here: the mining intermediate (a review queue, not an artifact) and
# the database file, which build_database.py recreates in seconds.
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/lexicon/data/candidates.csv
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/lexicon/data/*.db
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/lexicon/data/*.db-wal
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/lexicon/data/*.db-shm

# --- Runtime output --------------------------------------------------------
# Contains user text that was blocked or held; must never be committed.
azerbaijani-toxicity-moderation/moderation_audit.jsonl

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
